{
  "id": "universal-shffl",
  "name": "SHFFL",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": "all",
  "goal": "Short hop, aerial, fast fall and L-cancel in one motion",
  "why": "A SHFFL puts an aerial on an opponent at the ground's level and gets {char} back to acting in the fewest frames: the short hop keeps the aerial low, the fast fall brings {char} down at once, and the L-cancel halves the landing lag. It is the base of most approaches and of pressure on shield.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 120,
      "height": 10
    },
    "what": "A SHFFL is a short hop, an aerial, a fast fall at the top, and an L-cancel on landing.",
    "expect": "Each jump is judged when the landing lag ends: short hop or full hop, whether {char} fast fell, whether {char} landed during the aerial, and how many frames before the landing L, R or Z was pressed.",
    "example": [
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "A",
        "frame": "SA-4"
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": "SA",
        "hold": 3
      },
      {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": "NFL-2"
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: jump pressed and released: short hop",
      "SA-4": "Frame {SA-4}: the aerial",
      "SA": "Frame {SA}: the top. Stick tapped down: fast fall",
      "NFL-2": "Frame {NFL-2}: R pressed, 2 frames before the landing",
      "NFL": "Frame {NFL}: landed during the aerial. Landing lag, halved"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "Four inputs",
        "text": [
          "A SHFFL is four inputs in order. Release the jump button within {J-1} frames: a short hop. Press A or the C-stick: the aerial. Tap the control stick down from the top of the jump, frame {SA}: the fast fall. Press L, R or Z on the landing frame or up to 6 frames before it: the L-cancel.",
          "The aerial must still be going when {char} lands, or there is no landing lag to halve. Start it a few frames before the top, so it is still going when the fast fall brings {char} down."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "A",
                "frame": "SA-4"
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": "SA",
                "hold": 3
              },
              {
                "press": "R",
                "frame": "NFL-2"
              }
            ],
            "inputs_for": {
              "mr-game-and-watch": [
                {
